5. 修正取消标志的线程安全

把 private var isCancelled = false 替换为：

```swift
private let cancelFlag = ManagedAtomic<Bool>(false)
```

或者不引入额外依赖，直接：

```swift
private var _isCancelled = false

private var isCancelled: Bool {
    get {
        stateLock.lock()
        defer { stateLock.unlock() }
        return _isCancelled
    }
    set {
        stateLock.lock()
        _isCancelled = newValue
        stateLock.unlock()
    }
}
```

把 stateLock.lock() 段落里的 isCancelled = true 改为 self.isCancelled = true 即可。

