8. 音频独立线程

音频不参与帧级推理，直接透传。在 decodeStage 中不应该处理音频，而是启动一个单独的 audioStage，从 audioReaderOutput 读取音频并写入 audioWriterInput。

audioStage 目前是空的，需要在 run 中把 audioReaderOutput 传进去：

```swift
private func audioStage(readerOutput: AVAssetReaderTrackOutput, writerInput: AVAssetWriterInput) {
    while true {
        if isCancelled { break }
        guard let sample = readerOutput.copyNextSampleBuffer() else { break }
        while !writerInput.isReadyForMoreMediaData {
            if isCancelled { return }
            Thread.sleep(forTimeInterval: 0.002)
        }
        writerInput.append(sample)
    }
}
```

然后在 run 中：

```swift
if let audioReaderOutput, let audioWriterInput {
    let audioGroup = DispatchGroup()
    audioGroup.enter()
    DispatchQueue.global(qos: .utility).async { [weak self] in
        self?.audioStage(readerOutput: audioReaderOutput, writerInput: audioWriterInput)
        audioGroup.leave()
    }
    audioGroup.wait()
}
```

